---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
const title = 'Technology — Tanka';
const description = 'An overview of the technology work planned for the Tanka open-source digital currency project.';
---
<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} active="/technology/"><section class="container py-20 sm:py-28"><p class="eyebrow">Technology / In development</p><h1 class="display mt-5 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-medium leading-tight sm:text-7xl">Foundations before<br /><span class="text-cyan">promises.</span></h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-silver/65">Tanka's technical design is being developed in the open. This page will grow alongside the project; no operational network or wallet is being represented here.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="panel rounded-2xl p-7"><span class="eyebrow">Planned / Protocol</span><h2 class="display mt-5 text-2xl">An independent chain</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-silver/65">The project is exploring the protocol foundations for an independent, mineable digital currency. Technical details will be published as they are established.</p></article><article class="panel rounded-2xl p-7"><span class="eyebrow">Planned / Participation</span><h2 class="display mt-5 text-2xl">Mining and access</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-silver/65">Mining tools and ways to participate are part of the development direction. No mining network or rewards are currently live.</p></article><article class="panel rounded-2xl p-7"><span class="eyebrow">Planned / Wallet</span><h2 class="display mt-5 text-2xl">A straightforward wallet</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-silver/65">Wallet software is a future area of work. There is no official Tanka wallet available at this time.</p></article><article class="panel rounded-2xl p-7"><span class="eyebrow">Planned / Payments</span><h2 class="display mt-5 text-2xl">Everyday payments</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-silver/65">Payment and merchant tools may be explored as the protocol matures. No Tanka payment service is currently operational.</p></article></div><a href="https://github.com/serviceontheweb/tanka" class="mt-9 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-cyan">Follow technical development on GitHub ↗</a></section></SiteLayout>
